{"title":"What should I ask Joe Boyd?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/909849305/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Joe-Boyd.html","date":1734938780000,"content":"<p>Yes, I will be doing a Conversation with him.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joe_Boyd\" target=\"_blank\">from Wikipedia</a>:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p><b>Joe Boyd</b> (born August 5, 1942) is an American <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Record_producer\">record producer</a> and writer. He formerly owned <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hannibal_Records\">Hannibal Records</a>. Boyd has worked on recordings of <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pink_Floyd\">Pink Floyd</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairport_Convention\">Fairport Convention</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sandy_Denny\">Sandy Denny</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richard_Thompson_(musician)\">Richard Thompson</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nick_Drake\">Nick Drake</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Incredible_String_Band\">The Incredible String Band</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/R.E.M.\">R.E.M.</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vashti_Bunyan\">Vashti Bunyan</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Martyn\">John</a> and <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beverley_Martyn\">Beverley Martyn</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maria_Muldaur\">Maria Muldaur</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kate_%26_Anna_McGarrigle\">Kate &amp; Anna McGarrigle</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Billy_Bragg\">Billy Bragg</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/James_Booker\">James Booker</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/10,000_Maniacs\">10,000 Maniacs</a>, and <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Muzsik%C3%A1s\">Muzsikás</a>. <sup></sup>He was also one of the founders of the highly influential nightclub venue <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UFO_Club\">UFO</a>…</p>\r\n<p>Boyd was responsible for the sound at the 1965 <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Newport_Folk_Festival\">Newport Folk Festival</a>, when <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bob_Dylan\">Bob Dylan</a> played a <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Electric_Dylan_controversy#Newport_1965_set\">controversial set backed by electric musicians</a>.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>And:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>Boyd returned to the United States at the end of 1970 to work as a music producer for <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Warner_Bros.\">Warner Bros.</a> with special input into films, where he collaborated with <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stanley_Kubrick\">Stanley Kubrick</a> on the <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Clockwork_Orange_(soundtrack)\">sound track release</a> of <i><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Clockwork_Orange_(film)\">A Clockwork Orange</a></i>. Boyd also contributed to the soundtrack of <i><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deliverance_(1972_film)\">Deliverance</a></i>, directed by <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Boorman\">John Boorman</a>, where he supervised the recording of “<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dueling_Banjos\">Dueling Banjos</a>“, which became a hit single for <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eric_Weissberg\">Eric Weissberg.</a></p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.joeboyd.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Joe’s official website</a>.  Joe has a new and remarkably thorough and polymathic book out <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Roots-Rhythm-Remain-Joe-Boyd/dp/B0CJ6MZQ8N/ref=sr_1_1?crid=REMR4HV3VBI8&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.4ImmTkHbOivPOZXt_xfml5lTjrmoBVBqiG3QHUHTJ-JifWT9d16PEjvuuK0h953w.sh31hloV1AWnpJMq3zyA-kqj6HCTCrGVSBet8l135i8&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=joe+boyd+and+the+roots+of+rhythm+remain&amp;qid=1734899368&amp;sprefix=joe+boyd%2Caps%2C113&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">And the Roots of Rhythm Remain: A Journey Through Global Music</a>.  So what should I ask Joe?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/what-should-i-ask-joe-boyd.html\">What should I ask Joe Boyd?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/909849305/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/909849305/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/909849305/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/909849305/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/909849305/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/909849305/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/what-should-i-ask-joe-boyd.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/what-should-i-ask-joe-boyd.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a><h3>Related Stories</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/merry-christmas-16.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=merry-christmas-16\">Merry Christmas</a></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/what-ive-been-reading-263.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=what-ive-been-reading-263\">What I’ve been reading</a></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2024/12/jeffersons-doge-that-was-then-this-is-now.html?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=jeffersons-doge-that-was-then-this-is-now\">Jefferson’s DOGE (that was then, this is now)</a></li></ul> </div>","author":"Tyler Cowen","siteTitle":"Marginal Revolution","siteHash":"242a3a39129b36e0c574c3796ca7ef3cf8af967286c2998fabf7240d1ad52a47","entryHash":"7270e28a7774697abb5d7afaa3f944f435c182c966f0462f8915b30b2a973bd0","category":"Sites"}